     "INTERMEDIATE: passed to store.fetch({ phone })",
     "INTERMEDIATE: store calls client.verify() but drops phone",
     "DESTINATION: client.verify() sends {} to API",
     "MISMATCH: phone parameter dropped, API may require it"
